Wheel of Almost Death

A standalone, installable PWA. Works offline after first load.

Deploy to arrosho.com/wheel-of-almost-death
In the GitHub repo that serves arrosho.com, create a folder named exactly wheel-of-almost-death at the repo root.
Drop index.html, manifest.webmanifest, sw.js, and the icons/ folder inside it.
Commit and push. Live at https://arrosho.com/wheel-of-almost-death/

Every path is relative, so the folder name is the only thing that has to match. If you rename the folder, update the "id" field in manifest.webmanifest to match.

Notes
Options are saved in the browser on that device. Nothing is sent anywhere.
To ship an update, bump VERSION in sw.js (e.g. woad-v2) so installed copies pull the new files instead of serving the cached ones.
HTTPS is required for install + offline. GitHub Pages gives you that.
